        {
            "type": "table",
            "anchor": null,
            "rows": [
                {
                    "row": 0,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2. The following was identified as a result of the inspection:",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": true,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): 1. The quality documents provided do not include the lot number or the date of manufacture for the delivered products;2. The requirement of Section 5 of the Technical Specifications of the Supply Contract has not been met—the Material Safety Data Sheet (MSDS) has not been provided. /1. В предоставленных документах о качестве отсутствует номер партии и дата производства поставленной продукции;2. Нарушено требование раздела 5 Технического задания Договора поставки - не предоставлен Паспорт безопасности (MSDS).",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments): A visual inspection revealed a violation of the requirements of Section 7 of the Technical Specifications of the Supply Contract—the remaining shelf life of the goods must be at least 7 months at the time of delivery: in fact, 2 tons (40 bags of 50 kg each) are dated September 30, 2025, which is 4 months before the expiration date. /При визуальном осмотре выявлено нарушение требования раздела 7 Технического задания Договора поставки - остаточный срок годности товара должен составлять не менее 7 месяцев на момент поставки: фактически 2 тонны (40 мешков по 50 кг) имеют дату 30 сен 2025г, что составляет 4 месяца до окончания срока годности.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 4,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.4. Nonconformities (none, or give comments, Nonconformity Report no.): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 5,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "Conclusion:MATERIALS ARE                         ПУСТОТА ACCEPTED                          ГАЛОЧКА REJECTED",
                    "gridspan": 5,
